# The build context is the repo root, which is the Go module. Everything is
# excluded except the module's own sources, in tee-node's form: anything else
# reachable in the context would perturb layer hashes and undermine
# reproducibility. The sibling development build (Dockerfile.siblings.dev) has its
# own context one level above the repositories and is not filtered by this file.

# ignore everything
*

# include source and build files
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!pkg/
